          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Smart communication to help enhance school safety</span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Discover how wearable, voice-activated technology is helping schools facilitate everyday communication and emergency response. With one device, staff can call, message, broadcast and activate a panic alarm without reaching for a phone.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">The Smartbadge helps enable swift, coordinated responses by allowing staff to initiate lockdowns, notify teams and contact 911 from wherever they are on campus.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Learn how one small, wearable device could impact communication and safety for schools.<br>\n </span></span></p>\n",
